[00:05.473]I'm breathing, I'm feeling alone
{"我在呼吸　却感到孤独"}
[00:09.797]I know that you're leaving
{"我知道你要离开"}
[00:12.916]While we're still undone
{"趁我们还未结束"}
[00:15.950]It's gone right before our faces
{"它就在眼前消逝"}
[00:18.860]Gone without a trace
{"消失得无影无踪"}
[00:20.510]We had something special
{"我们曾拥有特别的情愫"}
[00:21.993]I don't need no space
{"我不需要任何距离"}
[00:23.262]
[00:23.796]So come back now
{"所以现在回来吧"}
[00:25.132]Won't you give me some hope, come on
{"能否给我些希望　来吧"}
[00:29.442]
[00:29.610]I'll be dancing like nobody is watching
{"我会忘情起舞　仿佛无人注视"}
[00:32.992]And I wanna be all you need for a second
{"我想成为你片刻的全部所需"}
[00:36.619]'Cause I'm into you
{"因为我已为你着迷"}
[00:42.057]Now I'm trying to get your attention
{"此刻我正试图吸引你注意"}
[00:45.309]So I'm calling you up on my best intentions
{"所以我怀着至诚拨通你电话"}
[00:49.373]'Cause I'm into you
{"因为我已为你着迷"}
