[01:17.507]Our eyes, they're shining so bright
{"我们的眼眸　闪耀如星"}
[01:21.617]When our hearts collide
{"当两颗心相撞的瞬间"}
[01:24.922]I don't need a doctor, you're my medicine
{"我不需要医生　你就是我的良药"}
[01:27.871]Giving me a high when walls are caving in
{"当围墙坍塌时　你让我腾空飞跃"}
[01:30.970]
[01:31.160]So come back now
{"所以现在回来吧"}
[01:32.730]Won't you give me something, tonight
{"今晚能否给我些回应"}
[01:37.084]
